WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.626
Ɓiidooji ɓerɗe Sindou. Goomu senoufo.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.434
Nder worgo hirnaŋge Burkina, laatooje mawngoje ɗon dari dow ladde. Ɓe mbi'i ɗi walaa goɗɗum.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.936
Sahaaji goɗɗi, gariiri senuufu ɗon jooɗoto nder worgo.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.072
Nde subaka, mawɓe koyɗeeji ngari njaɓɓa yimɓe.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.696
Duuje ɗon yiite, gariiri boo ɗon ndilli haa leɗɗe.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.568
Kamɓe ɓe njotti nyalawma mawɗe, nde Nakan woni ardiiɗo maɓɓe.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.050
Ɓiɗɗo go'o ɗon ɓilla. Gooduɗo sembe nder yimɓe fuu hoo'i mo e juuɗe muuɗum.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.014
Ɗoon! Kamɓe ɗon ndartina'en.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.554
Ɓe ngari haa hooseere. Walaa goɗɗo yi'i ko nandi bee maajum.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.256
Nakan waɗi dokkal dow koyɗe mawɗo.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.288
Ɓi'e ɓooyɓe nder kaaƴe, ndaaru min.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.554
Sey hayre nde'e ummii, ginnaaji ɗin njehi. Ɓe ngi'i yimɓe ɓe ngalaa wuro, ɓe njaɓti ɓe.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.696
Ɓe nyiɓi gariiri ndin nder kaaƴe, nden nduumi.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.104
Ammaa nder nyalnde go'oto, ɓe ɗon njooɗi.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.640
Nakan ummii, o noddi ginnaaji.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.132
Duule ɗon hoosi. Kamɓe mbi'i: "Kooƴe mburtinaama, koyɗe boo njogii.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.250
Yimɓe jooɗiiɓe dow kaa'e ndilli. Ɓe meeɗaa warugo.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:37.552
Yimɓe gariiri ɗon ngaɗi ɓerɗe belɗum, ginni'en boo mbi'i ɓe ndilli nder kaaƴe.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.688
Yimɓe ɓe'e meeɗaay laamii dow maɓɓe.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:08.112
Haa hande, nder Sindou, yimɓe ɗon mawnina ruuhuuji kaaƴe ngam hakkilantaago maɓɓe.
